Description:
We take the opportunity to introduce Masters Electro-Mechanical as a qualified contractor to provide the construction support in electrical field and technical services for your day to day or short / long-term operations in the field of Electro-Mechanical Installation & Maintenance.

The Master’s Electro-Mechanical is a Limited Liable Company established in the year of 1999 with 51% Shares owned by Mr. Mohammed Saeed Habban Dahdooh Al Kathiri. {A UAE National}
The other shareholder Mr.Mohammad Hamid Juniad {Pakistan National} 49% Shares Acts and performs as Chief Executive and General Manager of the company.
